# Two header rows with a rowspan in the leftmost column

"ID" spans both header rows (dotted border between them) and has no
sub-header beneath it. The merge lies entirely inside the header block.

+--------+-------+-------+
| ID     | North | South |
+........+-------+-------+
|        | Units | Count |
+========+=======+=======+
| 1      | a     | b     |
+--------+-------+-------+
